# Artalk project

Fork of [ArtalkJS/Artalk](https://github.com/ArtalkJS/Artalk) for `blog.themarfa.name`, reverse-proxied at `comments.themarfa.name`.

## Layout

| Path | Role |
|---|---|
| `compose.instance.yml` | Production compose — GHCR image only, no `build:` on VPS |
| `deploy/` | `artalk.yml.example`, `nginx-artalk.conf`, `.env.example`, instance scripts |
| `deploy/scripts/` | VPS deploy, backup, FastComments → Artrans migration |
| `exports/` | Comment dumps; gitignored — do not commit |
| `.github/workflows/deploy-instance.yml` | Build on GitHub → GHCR → SSH pull on VPS |

## Invariants

- Secrets (`ATK_APP_KEY`, admin passwords, API keys, Telegram tokens, SSH) live in `.env` or host env — never paste real values into tracked files, chat dumps, or README examples.
- Prefer env/`ATK_*` overrides over editing committed secrets in compose/YAML.
- Pin the Artalk image tag in compose for production (`instance-latest` or `sha-*`, never unpinned Docker Hub `:latest` for prod).
- Build the Docker image on GitHub Actions; the VPS only `docker compose pull` + `up --no-build`.
- Bind Artalk publish port to `127.0.0.1` only; public access goes through nginx (or TLS terminator) on the VPS.
- Keep `ATK_TRUSTED_DOMAINS` / site URL aligned with the blog and comments hostnames.
- Migration scripts: stdlib-first Python, argparse CLI, no new deps unless explicitly requested.
- Do not rewrite `exports/` data in place; write new output paths.

## Out of scope unless asked

Frontend Artalk widget embedding, blog theme changes, and unrelated cloud platforms (Vercel/Netlify).
